SY_TALK("EeO23r8zHm8",[[0,["Now, the question is, for a modern man,","whether to believe"]],[5,["that there are spirits or not."]],[9,["Because it’s a very unknown area."]],[12,["And the unknown area,"]],[17,["unless and until it is fully explored","and found out,"]],[22,["always creates a hallucination","that it is something divine."]],[28,["So we have to know even about spirits:"]],[31,["who are they, how they act,","and how they work out."]],[37,["Now, many will say","that “We do not believe in spirits.”"]],[39,["Whether you believe it or not —","but they are there."]],[43,["Christ, He was not a liar."]],[45,["He took out spirits","and put them in the pig."]],[48,["And He is the man who very clearly said","that “Keep away from the spirits.”"]],[55,["The spirits are the people."]],[59,["We can be spirits tomorrow","if we want to be."]],[63,["When we die, we do not die fully."]],[68,["Only the element of earth,","which has created us…"]],[74,["for appearance, or which is the…"]],[76,["we can say, the Jala Tattva","[Water Principle], with the gross form —"]],[80,["that portion only dies,","the rest of it remains."]],[84,["And it goes into an area"]],[88,["which we call as Pretaloka","[the world of the dead],"]],[91,["where it starts becoming","smaller and smaller"]],[94,["till it comes to the size"]],[99,["of a foetus,"]],[103,["or, you can say, a very small foetus."]],[108,["It waits there."]],[113,["But some of the people, when they die,"]],[117,["they are dissatisfied souls."]],[120,["In Sanskrit we call them","as atrupta atma [unsatisfied soul]."]],[125,["Means, in life they have been hankering","after things too much,"]],[131,["and they couldn’t get to their goals,","and they died."]],[137,["For example, a mother dies","during labour pains."]],[140,["Her child is born;","she sees the child and dies."]],[143,["She is worried","about looking after that child."]],[147,["A father dies suddenly in an accident."]],[150,["His children are left behind,"]],[152,["and he is worried about his children","they’re looked after."]],[156,["There are some people","who are very ambitious in life —"]],[160,["very, very ambitious —"]],[163,["and they die before fulfilling","their ambitions."]],[166,["They also become spirits."]],[169,["There are people who have been tortured","and troubled and killed."]],[174,["They also die, and they don’t want","to live in the Pretaloka,"]],[179,["but they want to trouble the people","who have troubled them."]],[182,["So there are types and types of people","who become spirits."]],[187,["We can divide them into two types."]],[191,["One type is the one","which is very aggressive,"]],[201,["ambitious, egoistical,"]],[206,["oppressive person,"]],[210,["who dies and becomes a spirit."]],[213,["That area is known","as the supraconscious area."]],[217,["So many gurus and sadhus [ascetics]","who renounce the world"]],[221,["and go to the Himalayas,","and break their necks,"]],[225,["and do all kinds of frantic things,"]],[228,["which we call as dravidi pranayam","[a roundabout way of doing a thing] —"]],[231,["when they die without Realization,"]],[235,["they also are","on the supraconscious side."]],[241,["And they remain on the right-hand side","of the human being."]],[247,["On the left-hand side…"]],[249,["“Human being” because human being","is a reflection"]],[252,["or, we can say, is the same microcosm","of the macrocosm, which is the Virata."]],[260,["Hence they are reflected","on the right-hand side of the Virata,"]],[265,["and so we should say"]],[267,["that they are available","on our right-hand side."]],[272,["The other ones,"]],[274,["we can say that they are… they belong","to the category of the people"]],[280,["who are suppressed, who are oppressed,"]],[282,["who are tortured, who are troubled,"]],[285,["who are debased, who are insulted."]],[288,["Such people, when they die,"]],[292,["they want to take their revenge","by their sly methods."]],[297,["So they remain on the left-hand side","of the Virata"]],[300,["and thus are reflected in us also,","in the collective subconscious,"]],[304,["which is on the left-hand side."]],[311,["Basically, these are the two styles","of people who are becoming spirits."]],[318,["But there can be a mixture,","there can be every type of a spirit."]],[323,["There could be good spirits also,","good people,"]],[326,["who are trying to only help","their families and things like that."]],[333,["These spirits try to manifest."]],[339,["For example,","the supraconscious type spirits."]],[345,["There was a doctor in London, who died.","His name was Dr Lang."]],[351,["When he died,","he had discovered lots of things,"]],[354,["and he wanted to continue","with his practice in London —"]],[357,["and he was a surgeon —"]],[358,["but he could not do it,","because he suddenly died."]],[361,["So his spirit entered into a soldier"]],[365,["who was living in…","who was fighting in Vietnam."]],[369,["And when the spirit entered into him"]],[371,["and told him","that “I am such and such doctor,"]],[374,["you must go and meet my son","and my brother"]],[378,["and tell them that I am within you,”","the soldier could not believe it,"]],[382,["but then he said","that “You come along with me,","and I’ll guide you to that place.”"]],[386,["And he took him to that hospital","where this doctor was working."]],[390,["The hospital was closed,","the surgery was closed,"]],[394,["so he went and saw the son,","and he told him about this spirit","entering into his body."]],[398,["The son could not believe it."]],[400,["So he said that “I will tell you","all the secrets of our life"]],[404,["that we spent together","and which no one knows.”"]],[406,["And when he started","telling him all these things,"]],[408,["he was amazed, he said,","“All right, I’ll open the centre.”"]],[411,["So they opened","a very-big-news organization"]],[413,["known as Late Dr Lang’s International","Curative Centre in London."]],[420,["Now, this organization","started working long time back,"]],[423,["about, I think, eleven","or twelve years back."]],[426,["Actually, I came to know about it","because somebody who was suffering"]],[429,["from the treatment","of one of these people,"]],[432,["she came to Me","and she told Me all about this,"]],[434,["and she gave Me a pamphlet","in which they had written","all this story about Dr Lang."]],[439,["And what they used to say —","that “You should write to us","about your illness whatever it is."]],[443,["And when you write to us,","then we will organize it in such a way"]],[446,["that at such a time, at such a point,","at such a place —"]],[450,["whichever place you suggest —"]],[452,["something will happen to you:","you’ll start shaking in the body"]],[455,["and you’ll get those spirits into you","and you’ll be cured.”"]],[458,["It happened with this lady,","the one who came to Me first","when she told Me."]],[462,["Then afterwards I’ve met many of them,","even in England I’ve met some of them."]],[467,["So, when she came to Me…"]],[469,["You see, what was her trouble was…","she said that “I had some trouble.”"]],[473,["I think she had some minor trouble,","which was cured"]],[475,["but was very inconvenient thing","for her —"]],[478,["sort of a… it was a nuisance,","the trouble was."]],[481,["She was definitely cured with that."]],[483,["But after, say, five, six years or so,"]],[487,["she started, you see,","shaking her body completely."]],[490,["Her nervousness was so much","that she couldn’t see Me."]],[493,["When she sat before Me,","she started shaking,"]],[495,["her hands started shaking,","body started shaking"]],[497,["as if a lunatic would do that","before Me."]],[500,["So I told her, “See, this gentleman","has come from lunatic asylum,"]],[503,["and he is behaving the same way","as you are behaving.”"]],[505,["She says, “I know.","Because I have a pain here,"]],[507,["I have a problem here…","And I know there’s something wrong."]],[509,["I am not thinking properly,","and I cannot remember anything."]],[512,["I am a lost soul,","and I know what has happened to me."]],[515,["Now what can You do about it?”"]],[516,["Of course, I then cured her, no doubt."]],[518,["Because in Sahaja Yoga you can —"]],[521,["through vibrations of love,"]],[523,["this Divine Love","which I told you yesterday —"]],[526,["you can give a bondage","to those spirits."]],[531,["By that bondage,"]],[532,["you can make that bondage pass","into the Pretaloka, and they disappear."]],[536,["But some of these are controlled"]],[539,["by some of these ambitious","so-called gurus."]],[543,["Now, these so-called gurus","that you know of —"]],[545,["so-called, they call themselves gurus —","what do they do?"]],[549,["They go… you see, if they find","some evil genius dies somewhere —"]],[553,["they know he is an evil genius —","then they follow his body,"]],[556,["they go to smashan [burning-ground],","they try to collect a part of his body,"]],[559,["and they keep it with them."]],[562,["Now, the spirit, till thirteen days,","moves around the body,"]],[565,["and it starts watching","what is the body doing."]],[569,["So, when the spirit, you see,","sees that his own part of his body —"]],[575,["which is to form again","in his own body later on —"]],[577,["is missing through these people","and they will be doing something,"]],[580,["so it appears before them,","and they know how to talk."]],[583,["It’s easy to talk.","Even ordinary spirit person,"]],[586,["if he comes here,","I can make them talk,"]],[588,["and they talk quite a lot,","all kinds of nonsense,"]],[590,["and they also tell about these people","what these people have been doing."]],[595,["So, that spirit then, you know,","is captured by these people,"]],[600,["and they start using","these supraconscious spirits."]],[603,["These people being crooked"]],[607,["and very intelligent people,"]],[614,["they start acting into their hands."]],[617,["Now, these spirits","are given some names."]],[619,["Like, they can call them Ram, Krishna…"]],[621,["Some people say Aim,"]],[623,["some says Hrim, some says Klim —","all Goddess’s names, you see."]],[626,["They can even give the name of Jesus","or something like that."]],[630,["So, what happens — that, when these…","when you go to these gurus,"]],[634,["then, when you ask them,","they say, “We’ll give you a mantra.”"]],[637,["Now, you think that the mantra-giving","is a very great thing."]],[640,["You see, so many people","will come and tell Me —"]],[642,["in Marathi also, Maharashtrians","are special ones for this —"]],[645,["that “Mataji, mala kani guru mantra dila","[some guru gave me a mantra].”"]],[648,["After all, a mantra can be given…"]],[650,["say, kay dila mantra “Ram”","[what if mantra “Ram” is given]?"]],[653,["Why do you need a guru","to tell you this? Use your brains!"]],[656,["Now, they go on saying “Ram”,"]],[658,["and this fellow has already connected","them with the Ram"]],[660,["whom they have appointed","to get into this fellow."]],[664,["So the Ram enters into the psyche","of this person."]],[666,["Mostly it is through this Agnya Chakra,","which I told you."]],[670,["Yesterday I described","the whole Kundalini"]],[672,["and its places and everything."]],[674,["So it enters through this","into the psyche."]],[676,["When it enters into the psyche","on the right-hand side,"]],[679,["you see, on the ego side","it enters into,"]],[681,["and it starts making the man","very egoistical."]],[684,["He’ll beat his wife,","he’ll beat his children,","he’ll rave and try to show off."]],[688,["Sometimes such a man","might get a promotion,"]],[690,["and he’ll become so dynamic,"]],[691,["he will… people will say,","“Oh, what has happened to him?” and…"]],[694,["sort of, you see, his attention,","which was…"]],[697,["was spent in doing other things,"]],[699,["will be diverted","to very ambitious style of work."]],[703,["Now, he becomes very ambitious,","but he has no dharma in him,"]],[707,["no love in him, no compassion in him,"]],[709,["but he becomes","a very so-called successful man."]],[712,["For a short time."]],[715,["But after… I’ve met many like them","in Delhi also,"]],[719,["those who have been","“initiated” like that"]],[721,["by paying quite a lot of money","to these swamis and sadhus —"]],[727,["and before Me","they were just rattling like this."]],[730,["And they said, “Mataji, this is such a lot","we are rattling before You,"]],[733,["but even if we take a… even if we burn","a udbatti [kind of incense sticks]"]],[738,["in the name of God Virata,"]],[740,["we can’t go near a temple,","we can’t go near a church."]],[744,["If we see anything of God,","we start rattling like this.”"]],[747,["And they all have resigned","from their jobs"]],[749,["and are settled down","as useless people."]],[752,["This has happened to them","within five, six years time."]],[755,["Young people, very young."]],[757,["In Singapore I’ve met one fellow.","No, not — Kuala Lumpur."]],[761,["You would not believe","he is only twenty-two years of age,"]],[764,["and he is like that now."]],[767,["And this is the supraconscious style —","they call it transcendental thought."]],[771,["This is the trance they use."]],[773,["So, just by giving you one name —","you must also think!"]],[776,["After all, you cannot call like that","your God, the Almighty."]],[781,["By just a name?! How can you call Him!","Is He your servant?"]],[785,["“Rama gari [fellow, man, man servant],","come along.” Can you call Him like this?"]],[788,["“You do my job, You look after my father,","You look after my mother.”"]],[792,["Who are you?"]],[794,["Are you entitled to call like that?"]],[796,["And can you just tell Him","that “You have to…"]],[800,["You better look after everything","that I tell You,"]],[802,["otherwise I’ll give You up.","I have no faith in You.”?"]],[806,["The man in his ego starts thinking","these nonsensical things."]],[810,["You have to surrender to God."]],[812,["You have to become one with Him,","you have to be authorized."]],[814,["Then only you can ask His help."]],[817,["The another supraconscious people","are another type of…"]],[821,["they work out in this way that, you see,","these people are the Hatha yogis —"]],[826,["so-called Hatha yogis,","because I call them neo-Hatha yogis."]],[829,["They are not real Hatha yogis."]],[830,["The real Hatha yogis never stay","with the human… normal…"]],[835,["what you call them…"]],[837,["citizens of a city or a village."]],[840,["They stay in the forest with gurus."]],[844,["In the Patanjali Shastra,"]],[846,["who is the original writer","of Hatha Yoga,"]],[849,["he has told there are six things","a Hatha yogi has to do."]],[852,["He has to stay in the jungle","with a guru who is a realized soul,"]],[856,["and he does not have to lead","a married life,"]],[858,["he has to be a brahmacharya,","a celibate person."]],[861,["And he has to do six things together."]],[864,["In that, meditation is there,","prana pratishtha [calming of the breath],"]],[867,["pratyahar [withdrawal of the senses],","yama-niyama [“dos” and “don’ts”]…"]],[869,["All these things mean","he has to regulate his life,"]],[872,["he has to lead","a very chaste and holy life."]],[874,["It is not meant for people","who are householders."]],[877,["Here now, for fashion’s sake,"]],[879,["the Hatha Yoga has come","to all the people,"]],[881,["and all Hatha yogis as such","get heart attacks."]],[885,["Yes, they do."]],[886,["I’ve met a doctor here —"]],[888,["you might be knowing him also very well,","he was a very well-known doctor —"]],[891,["and he was preaching Hatha Yoga,","and he had a heart trouble."]],[894,["And he was a heart specialist!"]],[895,["And when I met him, I told him,","“Doctor, be careful about your heart.","You are catching on your heart.”"]],[899,["He said, “How can that be?","I’ve taken my cardiogram!”"]],[901,["I said, “Doctor, be careful","and don’t do this Hatha Yoga.”"]],[904,["Because it is an extreme type","of a sadhana [spiritual practice],"]],[909,["which is to be done with a person","who can balance you,"]],[913,["where no other energy is exhausted,"]],[916,["but only thing is,","it is just done for the sadhana,"]],[919,["and your guru works it out."]],[921,["It is done by very few people."]],[923,["But nowadays everybody wants to become","a cinema actor and a cinema actress."]],[928,["Every girl wants to be [UNCLEAR]","certain shapes"]],[931,["that are described","in the beauty contest."]],[933,["I tell you, these proportions","are absolutely satanic."]],[939,["I’ve read those proportions —"]],[940,["they are not the proportions","of goddesses. Or of gods."]],[944,["These proportions that are described","in these beauty contest things"]],[947,["are absolutely of dirty women."]],[950,["These proportions,","if they exist in any human being,"]],[953,["only bad vibrations will come out."]],[955,["That’s why, you must have seen,","once they win that test,"]],[958,["then you have seen","how they become funny."]],[961,["These are all human conceptions,","but all the human conceptions"]],[964,["are such foolish things","that they do not know"]],[967,["that they are playing","into the satanic forces."]],[969,["The idea about cinema actresses,","you see — all the ladies, these days,"]],[973,["even in London,","even ninety-year-old women"]],[975,["want to be actresses."]],[977,["Are they mad?"]],[980,["They don’t want to be mothers."]],[983,["And then they will do","all kinds of dieting,"]],[986,["torture their husbands,"]],[988,["and they will… I don’t know","what they are up to."]],[990,["You have to be good wives,","decent wives."]],[993,["You have to be good mothers","first of all."]],[997,["You are married women,","you are not actresses."]],[1001,["And the husbands also want","to be actors or what, I don’t know,"]],[1005,["that they are at Hatha Yoga."]],[1006,["They want to make their body","very perfect"]],[1009,["in those dimensions","that they are described."]],[1011,["Who has said that these dimensions","are the best?"]],[1014,["I mean, these days, when you see it,"]],[1016,["men, they don’t look like men,","and women don’t look like women."]],[1020,["Women have started looking like men","or like horses,"]],[1023,["and men have started","looking like women."]],[1025,["It’s a wretched system."]],[1027,["We have to be women in the full way,"]],[1031,["and men have to be men in the full way."]],[1034,["You have heard about Shivaji, Rana Pratap","[legendary Indian warrior kings]…"]],[1036,["You have seen their personalities."]],[1040,["You see, all the descriptions","of these personalities"]],[1042,["going to drop down like anything"]],[1044,["when you see these “actors”","and “actresses”, teeny-leeny people:"]],[1048,["somebody slaps them once on the face,","the husband falls down dead,"]],[1052,["and the wife is running away","with another man —"]],[1054,["all sorts of things going on","in this ghor [terrible] Kali Yuga."]],[1058,["This is only you are playing","into the satanic forces. Nothing else."]],[1062,["But these, I tell you,","these supraconscious people"]],[1064,["are teaching you all these things."]],[1066,["Then there are people","of extreme nature,"]],[1070,["women specially,"]],[1072,["who are pativrata","[devoted to a husband], you see."]],[1075,["They are also nonsensical people."]],[1077,["Because, you see,","they think they love their husband,"]],[1079,["the whole gods must fall onto them."]],[1081,["Of course, a pativrata","is a very powerful personality."]],[1084,["But she has to be a realized person."]],[1086,["Otherwise, she is not realized,"]],[1088,["and she is all the time","making the husband, you see,"]],[1091,["a noose around his head all the time —","and using God for it."]],[1095,["Is absurd!"]],[1096,["She must allow all the freedom","to the man,"]],[1099,["to man to understand","the complete play of life."]],[1104,["These women also, when they die,","you see, they are afraid"]],[1107,["that their husband might marry","somebody else or whatever it is."]],[1110,["They sit on the husband’s head only."]],[1113,["Then the mothers, some of the mothers","who are so much involved"]],[1117,["and selfish and self-centred,","only love their own children."]],[1122,["They’ll say:","“He is the only son I have,”"]],[1125,["“She is the only daughter I have.”"]],[1127,["But what does that mean?","Why are you so misidentified?"]],[1131,["How many times you have been born","in this world?"]],[1133,["How many children","you have had before?"]],[1135,["Why are you so much involved into it,","so much misidentified?"]],[1139,["That does not mean","that you kick your children."]],[1141,["Either they will kick their children"]],[1143,["or they will be absolutely","downtrodden by the children."]],[1146,["This is the extreme type","of temperament."]],[1148,["Normal people, who love their children,","love other children also,"]],[1152,["live in a normal way,","normal, pious married life,"]],[1155,["don’t run after other men","and don’t run after other women —"]],[1159,["these normal people, when they die,","they go to Pretaloka,"]],[1163,["and then they are born again","as good people,"]],[1165,["and they, if they are born today,","they get Realization."]],[1170,["There are kinds and kinds","and types and types."]],[1172,["I don’t want to waste your time","and My time"]],[1175,["in describing all these horrid people."]],[1177,["But on the other side,","on the left-hand side,"]],[1179,["the debased and the sly","and the horrid and the murderers"]],[1182,["and all that — they are all there."]],[1184,["Oh, these are another type."]],[1186,["Now, what these people try to do?"]],[1188,["You see, sometimes","they will do some sly things."]],[1194,["But when these people enter,","these debased ones,"]],[1196,["when they enter into your psyche,","you become lunatic or mad,","or something happens."]],[1200,["They teach you all kinds of things."]],[1202,["They’ll teach you how to drink,","to take to drugs, to do these things;"]],[1204,["or if you are taking drinks,","they’ll enter into you."]],[1207,["Because they are drunkards,"]],[1208,["so they want to drink more —","so they will drink."]],[1210,["You’ll be amazed, you won’t believe","that in Cuba I met a lady,"]],[1214,["she was a very “dainty darling”,"]],[1216,["and she told Me that she can take","one whisky neat, one full bottle."]],[1221,["I mean, I can’t even look at that bottle","the way she showed Me."]],[1224,["I said, “How do you manage that?”"]],[1226,["And her husband said, “Really,","it is true, sometimes she does it.”"]],[1229,["So she says, “Do you know,","there’s a very big, huge Negro"]],[1231,["who enters into my body.","And then he drinks, not I.”"]],[1234,["She sees him coming inside this body."]],[1242,["So these types of people","are the other side,"]],[1244,["on the left-hand side."]],[1246,["Now, there are mixture types,","some of them."]],[1249,["You see, they are the people","who believe in God,"]],[1251,["and they haven’t found God,","and they have worked very hard…","sort of people."]],[1255,["So they try to give you","little, sometimes, assurances."]],[1258,["For example, yesterday one lady came,","and she told Me,"]],[1261,["“Mataji, suddenly I found","that there were some chanas [chickpeas]","lying in my house."]],[1266,["I thought they must have been given","by Mataji, so I ate them,","and I got cured.”"]],[1270,["I said, “Am I mad to give you chanas","and diamonds and this and that?”"]],[1278,["And there are some gurus also","who are working out","the so-called materialization."]],[1282,["This is nothing, you see.","Sometimes, you see, you find, in Bombay…"]],[1285,["now, you find that suddenly","your something is missing."]],[1290,["Most of the missing things","you’ll find there."]],[1293,["And these are the things","they are passing out to people","like this — come along! —"]],[1297,["in a… jadu me [in a magic way]."]],[1298,["It is… it is a spirit,","which is transparent."]],[1304,["It is not opaque thing,","you cannot see it."]],[1307,["So, it comes round, picks up anything","it feels like, and it goes away."]],[1311,["And it just disappears."]],[1312,["And it goes, and it can also give it","to some people there."]],[1318,["And this is all the vidya","[knowledge, lore] of spirit."]],[1321,["Now, how are you to know","that this is spirit and not God?"]],[1324,["Only ask one question:","what is the interest of God"]],[1327,["in giving us all these","nonsensical things"]],[1330,["which we are going to leave here only?"]],[1332,["When we die,"]],[1334,["all our diamonds, all our ornaments —","everything is going to lie down here."]],[1339,["So why should God give us","these things? Is He mad?"]],[1345,["You see, if He loves you,"]],[1346,["He’ll give you the highest,","the eternal, the greatest,"]],[1351,["the one that is promised","in all the scriptures."]],[1354,["And you read all the scriptures."]],[1355,["Do you find this kind of a nonsense","anywhere that Krishna came"]],[1359,["and He brought out some rings","and gave it to somebody?"]],[1362,["He did not."]],[1368,["I mean, it can be done by Him."]],[1370,["If He wants to do, He can do anything,","but He is not going to steal things."]],[1377,["So this kind of supraconscious spirits","and these things do exist,"]],[1380,["believe Me, they do."]],[1381,["But there’s nothing important for us,","because one exists in the future"]],[1385,["and another exists in the past."]],[1389,["We have to be conscious","of the present, present moment —"]],[1393,["and this is what Sahaja Yoga is."]],[1395,["That now, at this moment;"]],[1397,["you must understand","the dynamics of this moment,"]],[1399,["the spontaneity of this moment."]],[1404,["So now people will say, “Then that means,","Mataji, You don’t believe in planning.”"]],[1408,["I do not. I do not believe","in human planning at all."]],[1411,["Because when human beings plan,","you know what is the mess they create."]],[1415,["Everywhere in the whole world,","wherever there have been planners,"]],[1419,["what has been done?"]],[1421,["I’ll give you a simple example."]],[1426,["You plan a wedding, A to Z."]],[1430,["Now, you’ll find, suddenly,"]],[1432,["when the bridegroom has to come","from this place to that place,"]],[1436,["something will happen","and he won’t move."]],[1439,["He may have to go to the bathroom;"]],[1442,["maybe he wants to meet his mother,","he will be emotionally tied up;"]],[1445,["maybe his mother will come there,","and she might start crying…"]],[1451,["If you want to make it","a living marriage,"]],[1454,["then you should not plan","in such detail."]],[1457,["You must allow the spontaneity,","the blessing of God to work out."]],[1465,["In manner… I’ll give you","one example."]],[1468,["You see, I do not plan out much,"]],[1470,["and I don’t bother so much","about this planning out."]],[1473,["Today we wanted to come here","very early."]],[1476,["These people said","we must reach there at six thirty."]],[1478,["I was just laughing. I knew","when I had to reach I would reach,"]],[1481,["because, whatever they may try,","we cannot reach early."]],[1484,["[UNCLEAR]?"]],[1490,["And I just could not."]],[1493,["So why worry? Because I know","we are not going to reach early."]],[1498,["Of course, I mean, today","supposing I have to go tomorrow,"]],[1501,["so I have to just buy the ticket","for tomorrow."]],[1504,["Is all right, there’s no planning.","That is to be done today."]],[1508,["But A to Z you start planning","everything,"]],[1510,["and suddenly you find this is missing","and the whole thing goes off."]],[1515,["Let the spontaneity,","at least in human relationship —"]],[1518,["because you are such planners,","you cannot do everything else —"]],[1520,["but human relationship, at least,","try the spontaneity to work out."]],[1524,["Now, in the Western countries,"]],[1526,["people are understanding","the value of spontaneity,"]],[1528,["but they are stupid people,","they don’t know how to harness it."]],[1532,["I cannot even tell you","to what stupidity they go."]],[1535,["If I tell you, you won’t believe."]],[1541,["There are small children,","otherwise I would have told you."]],[1544,["It is impossible to believe","how stupid they are"]],[1547,["that they believe in the spontaneity"]],[1549,["and the kind of spontaneity","they have done."]],[1552,["All the developing countries","are now developing"]],[1555,["to be the developed countries,"]],[1557,["but we must also see in [UNCLEAR]","these developed countries are."]],[1562,["They are stupid people."]],[1567,["They are all right","as far as their work is concerned —"]],[1569,["they are all in time, their things","are all clean, spick and span."]],[1572,["But if you see,","their families are broken up."]],[1576,["Stupidity to such a limit —","a ninety-year-old woman"]],[1580,["having a love affair","with a nineteen-year-old man,"]],[1584,["and on the front page","their love letters are posted."]],[1587,["Every newspaper you have to read,","that is the first break news coming,"]],[1590,["and all the men reading","this “great” Romeo-Juliet going on."]],[1595,["Stupid, absolutely stupid!"]],[1597,["When you talk to them,","you find they’re such stupid people!"]],[1600,["You don’t know where to look","and what to say."]],[1603,["You have no idea to what extent","they have gone in stupidity."]],[1608,["Of course, they have Cadillacs,","and they have big cars,"]],[1610,["and they have big houses."]],[1612,["But sometimes I feel it is donkeys","living inside these beautiful houses."]],[1618,["In certain matters","they are absolutely stupid."]],[1622,["In certain matters,","absolutely, we are crooked."]],[1627,["They are innocent, simpletons,","but they are stupid people."]],[1631,["We are crooked.","Now, that point I’ll touch later on."]],[1635,["So, let us see now","that how these two types of spirits"]],[1641,["enter into us, into our psyche."]],[1644,["They can enter through this,","they turn this thing."]],[1648,["They turn this portion","and put inside."]],[1651,["Now, what happens with that,","with the spirit thing?"]],[1655,["There are some —","like Ravan was there,"]],[1657,["who could only with speech","he could make people naked, absolutely."]],[1662,["We have got one here,","exactly the same type."]],[1665,["If he goes on giving speech,","people start taking out their clothes."]],[1669,["Now, just think how stupid we are"]],[1671,["not to think: “By taking out clothes,","are we going to go near God?”"]],[1675,["I mean, what sort of a logic is this?"]],[1679,["When we take our bath,","we are all naked."]],[1682,["Are we nearer God by that?"]],[1686,["All sorts of absurd things","are being taught,"]],[1689,["and people are accepting.","Thousands of people!"]],[1692,["In your great Bombay, there are","so many intellectuals, aren’t there?"]],[1696,["Doing such silly, stupid things."]],[1705,["Then you will find lots and lots","of people just… organized."]],[1712,["For what?"]],[1714,["“Oh, there is some gentleman","has come, you know,"]],[1717,["and he speaks very well","on this thing."]],[1719,["And he is very good at this,","he’s a very great speaker.” —"]],[1722,["“What does he speak?” —"]],[1723,["“He speaks about how Radha","and Krishna loved each other.”"]],[1727,["Very good idea."]],[1733,["You can have free cabaret,"]],[1736,["and you can have free discourses","on all the nonsensical things"]],[1740,["debasing God Himself."]],[1743,["All these things are so interesting","to human beings!"]],[1746,["Are they really seeking the truth?","Are they really asking the reality?"]],[1751,["They will never read Shankaracharya.","Yesterday I told you."]],[1754,["They will never go and find out","what Markandeya had written,"]],[1758,["they have no time to find out","what Jesus has to say about it."]],[1761,["They don’t know","what Mohammed Sahib has said."]],[1768,["Nanak has said so many things,","Kabira has said so many things."]],[1771,["They are all fools."]],[1774,["These vice have come","from somewhere to teach us"]],[1777,["about all the satanic methods","that they want to employ on us."]],[1781,["So beware. Be careful."]],[1785,["This is the ghor Kali Yuga."]],[1788,["All these satanic forces are acting."]],[1791,["Krishna has said","that “Whenever there is need"]],[1798,["to establish the Dharma"]],[1801,["and to kill the dushtas [evil people]"]],[1805,["and to save the sadhus [good people],"]],[1807,["I am born again and again.”"]],[1810,["But, I find, who is the sadhu","and who is the dushta?"]],[1814,["It is such a mixture!"]],[1816,["The Satan has entered","into all the sadhus,"]],[1819,["and sadhus are absolutely","in a conflict."]],[1822,["This is what Kali Yuga is."]],[1825,["It’s a very delicate matter."]],[1832,["So, in our own being, as I said it,"]],[1834,["on the right-hand side","is the supraconscious area,"]],[1837,["and on the left-hand side"]],[1839,["is what we call","as the collective subconscious."]],[1843,["Nearer your own being"]],[1845,["is the subconscious","on the left-hand side,"]],[1847,["which we call as the psyche part,"]],[1849,["where we store everything","that is dead,"]],[1852,["of this life and past life."]],[1854,["And on the right-hand side,","is the preconscious mind,"]],[1858,["which we call as mana,","by which we —"]],[1861,["I don’t know, “mana” is also","very confusing thing,"]],[1863,["but English word is better,","is “preconscious mind” —"]],[1866,["with which we plan","and with which we think,"]],[1869,["and this body is maintained","through our right-hand side power."]],[1874,["In the centre, we have got","the evolutionary power."]],[1877,["By this power only, we have evolved,"]],[1881,["which is the conscious mind."]],[1884,["This moment, now, at this moment."]],[1887,["We can say that the past and future","cross like that,"]],[1890,["and in the centre is that point."]],[1892,["Or we can say like this: that the past…","the future and the past,"]],[1896,["they pass like this in the centre,","and they pass out."]],[1899,["So the thoughts from the past","come to the future,"]],[1903,["and the future to the past,","but they cannot stay at conscious."]],[1906,["For example, I say,","“Now, at this moment, stop it.”"]],[1909,["You cannot."]],[1911,["Why?"]],[1917,["Because of thoughts."]],[1919,["The thought rises,","goes up and falls down,"]],[1922,["and disappears like that."]],[1925,["Again, another thought rises,","rises and again falls, and disappears."]],[1930,["Now, you can see","the rising of the thought,"]],[1935,["but you cannot see","the falling of the thought."]],[1938,["In between these two thoughts,","there is a little gap"]],[1941,["known as vilamba [delay]","in the Sanskrit language."]],[1943,["That is the point of conscious mind."]],[1946,["The thoughts can come","from the supraconscious side,"]],[1951,["or can come","from the collective subconscious,"]],[1953,["can even come","from the preconscious,"]],[1955,["or can even come","from the subconscious."]],[1961,["That’s how the thoughts waves are."]],[1963,["But if you have to jump","into the conscious mind itself —"]],[1967,["now, at this moment —"]],[1970,["you cannot do it, because at that point","there is no thought."]],[1975,["I am not telling you","all these things of My own,"]],[1977,["because this has been already","discovered by many psychologists —"]],[1983,["that one has to jump","into thoughtless awareness,"]],[1986,["not into the so-called trance","but into awareness,"]],[1989,["which you are completely aware,","but inside there is silence."]],[1993,["Now, this silence has been described","by all the scriptures."]],[1998,["And while jumping into that…"]],[2000,["even the psychologists,","so many of them said"]],[2004,["that you jump","into an unconscious mind, which —"]],[2007,["“unconscious” means","which is not known to us, achetan mana —"]],[2012,["which is collectively conscious,","which is universal."]],[2016,["For example, we can say Jung is one","of the greatest psychologists,"]],[2020,["and I respect him very much."]],[2022,["He has done a lot of work","on the unconscious,"]],[2024,["and he has taken many years"]],[2030,["to experiment on thousands","and thousands of people"]],[2033,["to find out how the unconscious works","through dreams and symbols."]],[2038,["Now, he has found out many symbols","appear in the dreams."]],[2043,["For example, a triangle like this","appears in a dream of one man,"]],[2047,["pointing downward."]],[2049,["Invariably in all the cases,","wherever such a dream has appeared,"]],[2053,["such a man has murdered someone."]],[2057,["Or if the triangle","is just upside down,"]],[2061,["means the top is the pointer,"]],[2064,["then invariably all these people"]],[2067,["who saw this in the dream","and reported to him,"]],[2070,["they were murdered."]],[2075,["There are many such things","he has found out."]],[2077,["He has found out another thing","about the Universal Unconscious —"]],[2080,["that it always gives you a balance."]],[2086,["By different experiments."]],[2088,["Now, the medical science people"]],[2090,["have found out many things","which they cannot answer."]],[2092,["I have told you already","that they have found out"]],[2095,["that the acetylcholine and adrenaline,"]],[2096,["which act through the parasympathetic","and the sympathetic nervous system,"]],[2103,["they act very funnily in the body,","and they don’t know"]],[2105,["how they are controlled,","by whom, and why they act."]],[2108,["They say the mode of action","of these two chemicals is not known."]],[2112,["That means one thing is sure —"]],[2117,["that they cannot explain."]],[2120,["So, we have to think: why?"]],[2123,["Why a chemical should react","separate, differently?"]],[2127,["Because there is a deity","sitting within them!"]],[2130,["There is a deity, a living deity"]],[2132,["which handles the chemicals","in the way that it likes."]],[2135,["The other day also","I asked you a question:"]],[2137,["a medical person,","if you go and ask him,"]],[2138,["“If everything, every foreign body","is thrown out of the body,"]],[2142,["how is it a foetus is accepted,","not only that but nurtured in the body?”"]],[2149,["So we should know that there is","a Unconscious Universal Being,"]],[2154,["which is being accepted","by many people"]],[2159,["in the West."]],[2161,["And that’s why they say:","“Let the Unconscious look after."]],[2164,["Let us have the spontaneity,","let it work out spontaneously.”"]],[2167,["But they cannot,","they are so complicated now."]],[2169,["They have such an analytical mind","that they’ll go on analyzing,"]],[2172,["and they cannot allow","the spontaneity to work out."]],[2179,["They are trying all their methods","to work out the spontaneity,"]],[2185,["but somebody has to give an impetus,"]],[2192,["has to give that triggering,","as you can say."]],[2197,["Because through rationality if you want","to jump into unconscious, you cannot."]],[2201,["Rationality is a very limited stuff."]],[2204,["If you want to go to something","unlimited and universal —"]],[2209,["which is collectively conscious —"]],[2211,["then you have to learn","to be unlimited yourself."]],[2215,["Now, how will you do it?"]],[2219,["Somebody has to trigger it."]],[2226,["You see a light, a dip [lamp, candle]","which is not yet lighted."]],[2231,["It is a limited stuff."]],[2233,["But when you light it,","it becomes unlimited."]],[2236,["But for lightening this light,","you have to take another light near it."]],[2242,["When you bring another light near it,"]],[2244,["it doesn’t do,","it’s just like a catalytic agent."]],[2247,["It just touches this,","and it starts burning."]],[2251,["It gets unlimited light."]],[2254,["The light becomes unlimited","with a limited dip."]],[2259,["In the same way,","somebody has to trigger this."]],[2268,["I give a very, I should say,","a contemporary, or a very modern example"]],[2272,["which is very simple","for people to understand."]],[2275,["You see, in our houses, we have seen","all these Bombay gas lights,"]],[2278,["we have seen there’s a little flicker","going on. Nobody can see that."]],[2282,["In the same way,","in the heart there is the Spirit,"]],[2285,["the reflection of God that is there."]],[2289,["And the flow of the gas is stopped,","is kept ready."]],[2295,["In the same way,","in you the Kundalini is kept there,"]],[2300,["and somebody has to open that."]],[2305,["And when that is just opened,"]],[2307,["the Kundalini rises and meets","that flicker, and the light spreads."]],[2312,["And this is what happens","when the light spreads —"]],[2315,["that the vibrations start coming."]],[2320,["Thus you jump","into your unconscious awareness,"]],[2323,["means you become","a different personality."]],[2327,["As I told you, you are a computer."]],[2330,["But you are not a working computer."]],[2332,["Once you are connected","with the mains,"]],[2335,["you become a computer","which is giving information;"]],[2338,["suddenly you start feeling","on your fingers all these things."]],[2342,["You start feeling what is…"]],[2345,["what are the centres on the other person,","what are not working."]],[2349,["And these centres,","as I explained to you yesterday,"]],[2351,["have all the physical, mental,","and emotional sides, which they control,"]],[2357,["and you can make out","what’s wrong with the person."]],[2360,["You can cure them also","by giving them these vibrations."]],[2363,["So, through this computer,","now you get information,"]],[2369,["you give information,","and also you can correct it."]],[2374,["You can execute also information."]],[2376,["Now, our computers that we have,","they cannot execute."]],[2380,["(Somebody interrupts Shri Mataji,","and She asks not to interrupt Her.)"]],[2403,["You see, lecturing about Divine","has been done by many."]],[2410,["I am talking about actualization."]],[2415,["You become that!"]],[2418,["Now, always people say","that “How can it be possible, Mataji?”"]],[2423,["I mean, I cannot understand","this question."]],[2429,["Supposing I say","there is a diamond lying here."]],[2431,["Will you ask such a question?","You’ll immediately come pick it up."]],[2436,["I mean, you don’t have to lose","anything by this."]],[2440,["You are not paying Me anything.","It’s all free."]],[2443,["By doing this, you have seen here,","people have been cured."]],[2448,["But once you get it,"]],[2451,["fifty percent of you","will feel very happy,"]],[2453,["go home and say, “All right, forget it.”"]],[2455,["One or two will criticize: “Oh, mala kahi","jhala sei, we didn’t feel anything,”"]],[2459,["as if they are very great people."]],[2460,["If they haven’t got it,","there’s something wrong with them."]],[2463,["They should get it."]],[2466,["And fifty percent will think about it,","will come again and again, work it out."]],[2471,["There are now in Bombay","some of them,"]],[2473,["very highly placed Sahaja yogis,","who are curing people."]],[2477,["They have cured cancer.","They are very ordinary people."]],[2481,["We have one here, a teacher","in the school,"]],[2484,["and he has cured people","who were suffering from elephantiasis,"]],[2488,["from cancer…","so many things he has cured."]],[2491,["He is a very, very ordinary person","in life."]],[2495,["There are so many like that","who are doing it."]],[2500,["You can also do it."]],[2501,["But you are great babus","[respectable people],","you are great people."]],[2504,["You have no time for all this."]],[2507,["When I’ll be no more, then you","will be beating your heads, I know:"]],[2511,["“I wish we had done","something about it!”"]],[2518,["Some of them","have definitely learned the art."]],[2522,["Like, I said that “There’s a fan here."]],[2525,["If I open the fan,","you’ll get cool breeze.”"]],[2528,["So you’ll say, “All right. Please open","the fan immediately, we want to have it.”"]],[2531,["Normally people would say that."]],[2533,["Then I would say, “All right,","I’ll open the fan. Cool down."]],[2536,["Now you feel nice?” — “Yes.”"]],[2538,["Then I will tell you","how this fan is made,"]],[2540,["how the electricity is produced,","all the engineering I’ll tell you."]],[2543,["But I have also told you","a little bit of engineering."]],[2548,["All people want to listen to lectures."]],[2553,["Aren’t you fed up of them?"]],[2559,["Why don’t you have it?"]],[2563,["This is the blessing of God."]],[2565,["You have to jump","into the Kingdom of God,"]],[2567,["and you just see how you are protected,","how you are looked after."]],[2572,["There are seven chakras,"]],[2573,["and all the seven blessings","are bestowed upon you with a stroke."]],[2580,["We have here people who have been","nothing in life after Sahaja Yoga","[Shri Mataji probably means “before”] —"]],[2584,["even this one I will give you as a…"]],[2589,["as a little chocolate","over the castor oil, as they say —"]],[2593,["that they are also very much","improved materially"]],[2598,["because it is Lakshmi","who is sitting in the Nabhi."]],[2601,["This may appeal to many in India"]],[2605,["that Lakshmi is cured","and you improve even materially."]],[2608,["People get promotions,","they become this, that…"]],[2611,["One example is our Dr. Nagensi."]],[2613,["He got his Realization,","and see where he has got."]],[2618,["Many people like that."]],[2620,["He is a Sahaja yogi."]],[2624,["So many people are Sahaja yogis","who have achieved things in life,"]],[2627,["but they are busy people,","some of them are."]],[2630,["But if you could devote","a little time for sadhana,"]],[2634,["and if you come here","and see for yourself"]],[2637,["and give more, then you get more."]],[2639,["Because why should God","give you all the time vibrations"]],[2641,["when you are not going to use them?"]],[2643,["There’s a gentleman sitting here,","his son was suffering"]],[2646,["from too much of drug."]],[2648,["He was a young schoolboy,"]],[2650,["and he was being cheated,","and poor boy has been tried."]],[2654,["He has spent twenty thousand rupees","just curing him."]],[2657,["People were just giving him","drugs to sleep and drugs to sleep,"]],[2660,["only tranquillizers."]],[2662,["And in one day he’s cured, and today","he’s sleeping nicely without anything."]],[2665,["He had brought and showed Me","a prescription which, he says…"]],[2669,["Kiti paise bata [tell me how much was it]?","Charshe rupaye —"]],[2670,["four hundred rupees","poor man had to shell out."]],[2674,["And for what? Not for curing!","To make that boy sleep off."]],[2678,["I mean, that’s also a kind of a drug.","And that boy is so normal today."]],[2686,["But there will be some satanic here","who can create problem for you."]],[2691,["So you decide for yourself."]],[2692,["(Shri Mataji asks the audience in Hindi","to ask Her questions.)"]],[2693,["(Shri Mataji says a phrase in Marathi.)"]],[2719,["(A seeker asks a question.)"]],[2725,["SHRI MATAJI: How one gets it, isn’t it?"]],[2727,["All right, sit down."]],[2728,["That’s what I’ve been saying —","that it just works out."]],[2731,["It is a spontaneous happening."]],[2734,["Now, we’ll see one thing,"]],[2736,["that how does a little seed","gets into a tree?"]],[2740,["It’s a living process."]],[2741,["You’ll just say it just works out."]],[2744,["It is already there,","that’s why it is sahaja."]],[2746,["“Saha” means “with”, “ja” means “born”."]],[2748,["It is absolutely spontaneous."]],[2751,["I am an enlightened person, is a fact."]],[2754,["And when I touch you,","you get enlightenment yourself."]],[2758,["It’s a very, very simple thing.","All right?"]],[2767,["Another question?"]],[2769,["This was a nice one,","because we always say of “how”."]],[2773,["SEEKER: Enlightenment through","other methods,"]],[2778,["with siddhis [supernatural powers].","SHRI MATAJI: Huh?"]],[2780,["SEEKER: With siddhis,","that’s what they are called."]],[2782,["SHRI MATAJI: No, no, is wrong."]],[2784,["That is always been banned."]],[2786,["You see, in the olden days also","we had people who were misled."]],[2791,["That is the history."]],[2793,["There are some people…","now, for example, if we had Hitler,"]],[2796,["that doesn’t mean he’s a praman","[right measure, authority]."]],[2800,["If we had somebody like…","a satanic force like Ravan,"]],[2804,["doesn’t mean that he was praman."]],[2806,["For us, pramani is whatever achieved","the maximum."]],[2810,["So the praman always remains the best."]],[2812,["You see, all such people","who say that it gives siddhis"]],[2816,["are the people who are Tantrikas","[followers of the Tantra doctrine]."]],[2819,["And they were all thrown out."]],[2821,["These are all known as kshudrata","[insignificance, meanness]."]],[2826,["But some of the people","who have written books on these things"]],[2829,["are not themselves realized,","have read this book, that book,"]],[2832,["and then they have said","that their siddhis are also there."]],[2835,["Siddhis are nothing but you move on","to your supraconscious side."]],[2839,["And when you move on","to a supraconscious side,","a spirit comes into you."]],[2842,["And then what happens — you start","producing something from your hand…"]],[2846,["We had one lady in our Sahaja Yoga,","she came to us,"]],[2849,["and, you know, when I went to America,"]],[2850,["she started showing","all kinds of chamatkaras [wonders]."]],[2853,["She started telling people"]],[2855,["that “Where is your money’s lost,","you can find there,” like that."]],[2858,["And she became very popular,","and she used to get one thousand people"]],[2860,["everyday coming to her."]],[2862,["And ultimately she started telling them","even the number of the [UNCLEAR]."]],[2868,["So the supraconscious things","can be like that."]],[2871,["ESP, you become","an extrasensory perceptive man,"]],[2874,["and all that is nothing","but another spirit."]],[2879,["But human beings sit tight."]],[2881,["You’ll be surprised, from America","two great scientists came just to see Me."]],[2884,["For what?"]],[2885,["They said, “You must teach us how to fly","in the air. We want to leave our body.”"]],[2889,["I said, “Why? Are you not flying","already on our heads?"]],[2891,["Now what do you want to do?”"]],[2892,["They said, “Now we want to leave","our bodies and fly in the air.”"]],[2896,["So I said, “But if I tell you"]],[2897,["that this is done through the spirits,","will you do it?” —"]],[2900,["“Yes, still we want to do it.”"]],[2902,["I said, “Why?”"]],[2903,["They said, “Because Russians are doing","the same, so we want to do.”"]],[2906,["(Shri Mataji says a phrase in Marathi.)"]],[2912,["Then I said…","and they would not, you see."]],[2914,["Then I asked them, “Who told you?”","So they said, “Patanjali.”"]],[2916,["You know, Patanjali is a newspaper man."]],[2920,["And Patanjali… I said,","“Look at this fellow, he came for treatment"]],[2923,["because he used to get this kind of a…","experience that used to leave his body,"]],[2927,["and he came to Me for getting cured.”"]],[2929,["And he is telling him, you go to Mataji","and She’ll make you that!"]],[2934,["And these fools, you know,","they would not listen to Me!"]],[2941,["So, the knowledge that we have…"]],[2943,["we do not have a proper method","of discrimination."]],[2946,["We don’t know what is","absolute knowledge. This is wrong."]],[2949,["For that, you must have vibrations."]],[2953,["With vibrations. Now you can ask,","all those who are realized,"]],[2955,["you can ask: “Is there God or not?”","See the answer you’ll get."]],[2962,["[UNCLEAR] means yes."]],[2973,["All answers come,","and you can record it on your hands."]],[2976,["Even to a small thing."]],[2979,["You must hear Pharkay,","today he was telling Me about this,"]],[2982,["that when he… some gentleman","was somewhere,"]],[2985,["and he said","that “You just find his vibrations.”"]],[2987,["So he put his hands there,"]],[2989,["and he said, “Let me see the vibrations” —","and nothing was coming,"]],[2991,["and nothing you could feel,","and nothing of the chakras."]],[2994,["So he then said, “He cannot be there,","because I cannot feel anything.”"]],[2997,["So, this man thought of him:","“Oh, yes, yes."]],[2999,["He must be on the aeroplane,","he is not there.”"]],[3002,["To such an extent it goes!"]],[3005,["In London, there’s one gentleman,"]],[3007,["he said, “Mataji, can I feel","somebody’s vibrations?”"]],[3009,["I said, “You can.” —"]],[3011,["“Can I feel my father’s?”"]],[3012,["I said, “Yes. All right,","you put your hands and ask a question.”"]],[3015,["Immediately his Vishuddhi Chakra","started burning."]],[3017,["He said, “Mother, this is burning.”"]],[3018,["I said, “You telephone to him just now.","Ask how he is.”"]],[3021,["So his mother said, “He cannot talk","to you, his throat is very bad.”"]],[3027,["And the father was very far away."]],[3030,["“He cannot talk to you,","his throat is very bad” —","Vishuddhi Chakra is catching."]],[3038,["All the information you get","on your hand, on your vibrations."]],[3042,["And then, when you’ll see these books,","you’ll be surprised","they’ll be burning your hands."]],[3046,["(Shri Mataji says a phrase in Hindi.)"]],[3053,["You’ll be amazed that how you find out","who is a real guru and non-real guru."]],[3058,["It’s so correct with this!"]],[3060,["We have got here a case of one lady."]],[3063,["She told Me that somebody","came to see her,"]],[3066,["and, I mean, somebody","came to stay with her,"]],[3068,["her own brother or someone very near."]],[3071,["And she started burning","all the time, this and that."]],[3073,["So she said,","“Do you go to Satya Sai Baba?”"]],[3076,["He said, “No.”"]],[3077,["She said, “No, but how can that be?","I am getting terrible burning,"]],[3080,["as I get it from a disciple","of Satya Sai Baba."]],[3082,["You must have been somewhere.","You must have been.”","He said, “I’ve never been there.”"]],[3085,["So she said, “Really?”"]],[3086,["And she was searching him out,","and nothing was there."]],[3088,["So she opened his box, and in the box","there was a Satya Sai Baba’s photograph."]],[3095,["Our [UNCLEAR] is here, you can ask him."]],[3097,["His wife… his daughter-in-law","was a big problem in London."]],[3101,["And they didn’t know how to locate","why she was behaving like this"]],[3104,["and she was giving them","burning like that."]],[3106,["They opened her purse one day,","and in the purse was that photograph."]],[3109,["The day they threw it away,","everything is all right."]],[3111,["Otherwise it was going to be a divorce,"]],[3112,["for nothing at all — the poor lady","was vomiting, doing all kinds of things."]],[3116,["There are so many cases like that."]],[3122,["I mean, the proof is there."]],[3125,["(Shri Mataji says a few phrases","in Marathi.)"]],[3133,["He called us to some place"]],[3135,["where there was a centre","of Satya Sai Baba."]],[3137,["He said, “Mataji, You must save","those people.”"]],[3139,["When I sat there,","so many children just fainted."]],[3144,["Then they told us that “These children","have been fainting like this."]],[3147,["You have to do something about it."]],[3149,["And so many children are lost."]],[3151,["They just go away.","God knows how they are lost.”"]],[3156,["I told him, “Baba, his centre,","let him look after now. I am fed up.”"]],[3160,["What am I to do now?"]],[3162,["I must first of all create some doctors,","some realized souls."]],[3166,["When I have some more people","to work it out, we can work it out."]],[3170,["But one thing is there:","after getting Realization you must come,"]],[3173,["and learn it, and master everything."]],[3176,["You become… I tell you,","each and everything of Kundalini,"]],[3178,["you can just master it."]],[3180,["It’s very easy."]],[3184,["It is so easy and it helps you."]],[3185,["You know this is the power of love;","you must know how it is worked out."]],[3188,["We know all the power of hatred only."]],[3191,["Supposing somebody","is very unkind to you."]],[3194,["I’ll tell you","about My husband’s secretary."]],[3196,["She got her Realization.","And she said, “I have got neighbours,"]],[3199,["some three, four young boys,","and they are horrible hippies."]],[3201,["They are making noise,","and they are troublesome,","and they call me an old hen."]],[3205,["What have I to do","if they just make fun of me?”"]],[3208,["I said, “All right, what will you do?”"]],[3211,["She said, “I’m really fed up,","I’m going to give up the house.”"]],[3213,["I said, “You just don’t do like that."]],[3215,["You just go and put a bandhan","on their house,"]],[3218,["every day thrice, like this,","and just think of Me with love.”"]],[3223,["Now she says that it is quiet","like a churchyard."]],[3227,["“They are very quiet."]],[3229,["And they are very kind,","they open the lift for me."]],[3231,["When I go, they help me.”"]],[3239,["(A seeker asks a question in Hindi.","Shri Mataji answers first in Hindi","and then continues in English.)"]],[3271,["You are the instrument."]],[3274,["You are the instrument,","you are the medicine,"]],[3277,["you are the curer,","you are the doctor,"]],[3280,["you are the computer,","you are everything."]],[3285,["But you should become your Self."]],[3290,["You have to become your Self."]],[3300,["(Shri Mataji continues to speak in Hindi.)"]]]);
